  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat(core): support OpenAPI 3.2 metadata fields (#260) 2026-04-09\n- feat(csharp): support OpenAPI 3.2 sequential streaming (#259) 2026-04-09\n- feat(csharp): support OpenAPI 3.2 query parameters (#258) 2026-04-09\n- feat: preserve OpenAPI security requirement semantics (#256) 2026-04-09\n- feat(core): preserve security requirement semantics (#255) 2026-04-09\n- feat: expand OpenAPI 3.1 keyword normalization (#253) 2026-04-09\n- [codex] add vendor extension compatibility layer (#252) 2026-04-09\n- feat(http): surface callbacks webhooks and links (#250) 2026-04-09\n- feat(cli): expand gRPC scaffolding workflows (#249) 2026-04-09\n- feat: add configurable csharp identifier character sets (#244) 2026-04-08\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- feat: preserve OpenAPI security requirement semantics (#256) 2026-04-09\n- [codex] add vendor extension compatibility layer (#252) 2026-04-09\n- fix: restore shared helper emission 2026-04-08\n- fix: support two-project source generation 2026-04-08\n- test: fix allof trim assertion 2026-04-06\n- fix: clone oauth2 requests without missing polyfills 2026-04-06\n- fix: sanitize generated authorization helpers 2026-04-06\n- fix: restore trim-safe serializer context for huge unions 2026-04-06\n- fix: support CPM restore for source generators (#222) 2026-04-04\n- fix: repair system.net.http.json snapshot compatibility 2026-04-03",
